# Override slot for the web app, and this file is committed.
#
# Commented out on purpose: the authoritative default lives in the repo-wide `../.env`, and this
# file outranks it. Uncomment only to point this package somewhere the repo-wide value should
# not follow it to.
#
# Never put a secret in here. Beyond the usual reason, vite exposes every `VITE_`-prefixed
# variable to browser code, so one written here would ship inside the bundle.

# Where the dev server proxies /api. Development only, and must match the api's PORT.
#VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:3000
